001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TMFRPTA.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400 INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JUNE 1985.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.
      *     S P E C I A L    V E R S I O N   F O R   A K R O N
001900*   CATALOG BY MANUFACTURER'S NAME, KEYWORD-MODIFIER OR CODE.    E.
002000*
002100***************************************************************
002200***************************************************************
002300***                  T M F R P T A                          ***
002400***                                                         ***
      ***      SPECIAL VERSION FOR AKRON PLANT 1 TO ONLY INCLUDE  ***
      ***      THOSE ITEMS HAVE A LOCAL CODE OF "121A STORES"     ***
      ***      WHEN PRODUCING A CODE CATALOG.                     ***
      ***                                                         ***
002500***      THIS PROGRAM WILL PRINT A CATALOG WHICH IS SORTED  ***
002600***      BY STOREROOM CODE, LOCAL CODE, KEYWORD/MODIFIER,   ***
002700***      OR BY MANUFACTURER'S NAME.  FOR EACH TYPE OF       ***
002800***      CATALOG THE USER MAY SPECIFY A RANGE OR REQUEST    ***
002900***      ALL CODES.  THE USER ALSO HAS THE OPTION OF        ***
003000***      SPECIFYING THAT EITHER PRIMARY OR SECONDARY        ***
003100***      LANGUAGE DESCRIPTIONS BE PROVIDED.                 ***
003200***                                                         ***
003300***************************************************************
003400*   CALLING PROGRAM:    TRSCREEN                              *
003500*   PASSED PARAMETERS:  1.  LOW RANGE     (OR "ALL")          *
003600*                       2.  HIGH RANGE                        *
003700*                                                             *
003800*   CALLED PROGRAMS:  TBLOWUP   (ABORTS PROGRAM CLEANLY)      *
003900*                     THDPRT2   (PRINTS REPORT HEADER)        *
004000*                     TDATECHK  (FORMATS U.S./EUROPEAN DATE)  *
004100***************************************************************
004200***************************************************************
004400*    JAN. 10, 1986                         BARBARA WINTER
004500*          ADDED ABILITY TO PRINT SECOND LANGUAGE
004600*          DESCRIPTION.  CHANGED PROGRAM FROM PRINTING
004700*          THROUGH JSPOOLER AND USING XPRTRPT.OBJECT TO
004800*          PRINT.  IT NOW PRINTS STRICTLY TO AN MPE
004900*          PRINTER TO HELP PROCESSING TIME.
005000*
005100*    JAN. 19, 1986                         ANNETTE KRAUSS
005200*          ADDED CAPABILTY TO PRINT CATALOGS BY KEYWORD-MODIFIER
005300*          AND CODE.  CATALOG DESIRED IS SELECTED THRU THE USE
005400*          OF THE JCW.
005500*
005600*    FEB. 03, 1986                         CATHERINE KALMAN
005700*          1. CALLS TESCSEQ FOR EXTERNALLY SUPPLIED
005800*             ESCAPE SEQUENCES.
005900*          2. COPIES ESC-NAM2 FROM COPYLIB.DB.
006000*          3. MOVES ADDED TO INSERT PROPER ESCAPE
006100*             SEQUENCES FOR PRINTING.
006200*
006300*    APRIL 29, 1986                         BARBARA WINTER.
006400*          ADDED LOCAL CODE TO CODE CATALOG (42) AND THE ABILITY
006500*          TO SORT BY CORPORATE CODE OR BY LOCAL CODE.
006600*          DAB REQUESTED TO TAKE AWAY OPTION TO PRINT 2 LANGUAGE
006700*          DESCRIPTIONS AT ONCE AND ONLY PRINT PRIMARY OR SECONDARY
006800*          ONE AT A TIME.  IF THE HIGH RANGE IS THE SAME AS THE
006900*          LOW RANGE, THE HIGH RANGE CAN NOW BE LEFT BLANK.
007000*          THE JCW NUMBERS ON THE SCREEN ARE NOW IN SUPRESSED
007100*          PRINT SO THAT THEY DO NOT SHOW UP AND CONFUSE THE USER.
007200*
007300*    SEPTEMBER 15, 1986                     BARBARA WINTER.
007400*          THE SORT-FILE HAD AN ASSIGN STATEMENT OF
007500*          "SORT,DA,,,1024".  THE MFRSRT FILE KEPT BLOWING
007600*          DOWN BECAUSE OF NOT ENOUGH SPACE IN DANVILLE.
007700*          CHANGED SORT-FILE STATEMENT TO DEFAULT TO 10000
007800*          FILE SIZE, SO MFRSRT SHOULD BE THIS SIZE ALSO NOW.
007900*
008000*    JANUARY 14, 1987                       D.A PLUM.
008100*          REVISED PROGRAM TO MAKE USE OF NEW COPYLIB MEMBERS.
008200*          ALSO ADDED CALL TO "CDESC" TO OBTAIN CODE DESCRIPTIONS.
      *C
      *C   14FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   13AUG1998  DAVE PLUM
      *C     CREATED THIS SPECIAL VERSION OF TMFRPT TO ALLOW FOR THE
      *C     CREATION OF CODE CATALOGS WHICH ONLY INCLUDE THOSE ITEMS
      *C     HAVING A LOCAL CODE OF "121A STORES".  THIS FUNCTIONALITY
      *C     WAS NEEDED BY JUDY FINNEY OF THE AKRON PLANT 1 STOREROOM.
      *C
