035200**************************************************************
035300*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
035500**************************************************************
035600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA DATA-LINE-LINK.
035700 00-MAIN.
035800     PERFORM 010-OPEN-FILES               THRU 019-EXIT.
035900     PERFORM 030-GET-PARAMETERS           THRU 039-EXIT.
036000     PERFORM 100-DETERMINE-DESIRED-REPORT THRU 199-EXIT.
036100     PERFORM 300-SORT                     THRU 399-EXIT.
036200     PERFORM 400-PRINT-REPORT             THRU 499-EXIT.
036300     PERFORM 020-CLOSE-FILES              THRU 029-EXIT.
036400     GOBACK.
036600*************************************************************
036700*           OPEN DATABASE AND PRINT FILE                    *
036800*************************************************************
036900 010-OPEN-FILES.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-I DCODE-I DMANPART-I MPLTINFO-I.
037400
      *----- CALL CCRTFILE TO CREATE A TEMPORARY FILE FOR SORTING
      *----- LIBRARY 'QTEMP' IS USED FOR TEMPORARY FILES
           MOVE SPACES        TO CCRTFILE-PARMS.
           MOVE "QTEMP"       TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "SORTED"      TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE "0117"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           MOVE "90000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS.
           MOVE "02000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT.
           MOVE "10"          TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE OF 'SORTED' FAILED"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
037500*----------  OPEN OUTPUT FILE
037600     OPEN OUTPUT SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
037700
037800*----------  GET RECORD FOR PLANT NUMBER
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE "P 01" TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
033300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
033400           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO - TDOCKUDC " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033500           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
038500     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO PLANT-NUMBER.
038600
038700     MOVE "PLAN" TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
039000     IF NO-ENTRY
039100        MOVE "MPLTINFO DOES NOT HAVE LANGUAGE KEY 'PLAN'"
039200              TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039300        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
039400     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
039500        MOVE "DBGET2 MPLTINFO 010 TMFRPTA" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039600        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
039700
039800*----------  VALIDATE LANGUAGES IN MPLTINFO
039900     MOVE PRIMARY-LANGUAGE TO LANGUAGE-VALUES.
040000     IF NOT VALID-LANGUAGE
040100        MOVE "MPLTINFO PRIMARY LANGUAGE NOT VALID"
040200                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
040300        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
040400
040500     IF SECONDARY-LANGUAGE NOT = SPACES OR ZEROES
040600        MOVE SECONDARY-LANGUAGE TO LANGUAGE-VALUES
040700        IF NOT VALID-LANGUAGE
040800           MOVE "MPLTINFO SECONDARY LANGUAGE NOT VALID"
040900                             TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
041000           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
041100
041200     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
041300     MOVE CHAR-1636PI TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
041400     MOVE CHAR-10PI TO NORMAL-PRINT.
041500     MOVE TEXT-LENGTH-61 TO ESC-TEXT-61.
041600
041700 019-EXIT.  EXIT.
041900*************************************************************
042000*               CLOSE DATABASE AND PRINT FILE               *
042100*************************************************************
042200 020-CLOSE-FILES.
042300     WRITE PRT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61 AFTER ADVANCING 0.
042400     WRITE PRT-REC FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
042500     CLOSE PRT-FILE, SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
042600     CLOSE MPLTINFO-I DCODE-I DMANPART-I MSTORERM-I.
042700
042800 029-EXIT.  EXIT.
043000*************************************************************
043100*************************************************************
043200*   ACCEPT TWO LINES OF DATA: 1) ALL HEADER INFORMATION -   *
043300*     WHO AND WHERE THIS REPORT WILL BE ROUTED TO  2) A     *
043400*     RANGE OR THE WORD "ALL"                               *
043500*                                                           *
043600*  1-06-86  ADDED LANGUAGE PARAMETERS:  PRIMARY, SECONDARY  *
043700*           OR BOTH LANGUAGES.  THE FOLLOWING VARIABLE      *
043800*           DETERMINES WHAT TO PRINT IN THE REPORT:         *
043900*      01  PRINT-LANGUAGE       PIC X.                      *
044000*          88  PRIMARY-ONLY     VALUE "1"    (DEFAULT)      *
044100*          88  SECONDARY-ONLY   VALUE "2"                   *
044200*          88  PRINT-BOTH       VALUE "3"                   *
044300*************************************************************
044400*************************************************************
044500 030-GET-PARAMETERS.
           MOVE AREA1 TO DATA-LINE.
045000
047000     IF RPT-JCW-MNF = "40"
047100        IF LOW-RANGE-MNF = "ALL"
047200           MOVE "A" TO ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG
047300        ELSE
047100           IF HIGH-RANGE-MNF = SPACES
047200              MOVE LOW-RANGE-MNF TO HIGH-RANGE-MNF
047300           ELSE
047400              NEXT SENTENCE
047500     ELSE
047600     IF RPT-JCW-KWM = "41"
047700        IF LOW-RANGE-KEY = "ALL"
047800           MOVE "A" TO ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG
047900        ELSE
047100           IF HIGH-RANGE-KEY = SPACES
047200              MOVE LOW-RANGE-KEY TO HIGH-RANGE-KEY
047300           END-IF
047400             IF  HIGH-RANGE-MOD = SPACES
047400               IF LOW-RANGE-MOD = SPACES
                       MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO HIGH-RANGE-MOD
                     ELSE
                       MOVE LOW-RANGE-MOD TO HIGH-RANGE-MOD
                     END-IF
                   END-IF
048100     ELSE
048200     IF RPT-JCW-CODE = "42"
048300        IF LOW-RANGE-CODE = "ALL"
048400           MOVE "A" TO ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG.
048500
045100     IF RPT-JCW-MNF = "40" THEN
045200        MOVE RPT-JCW-MNF    TO RPT-JCW
045300        MOVE LANG-MNF       TO PRINT-LANGUAGE
045400        MOVE "DHDR40.PUB"   TO HD-FILE-NAME
045500     ELSE
045600     IF RPT-JCW-KWM  = "41"
045700        MOVE RPT-JCW-KWM    TO RPT-JCW
045800        MOVE LANG-KWM       TO PRINT-LANGUAGE
              IF LANG-KWM NOT = "2" AND LANG-KWM NOT = "3"
                  MOVE "1"        TO PRINT-LANGUAGE
              END-IF
045900        MOVE LOW-RANGE-KEY  TO WSL-KEY
046000        MOVE LOW-RANGE-MOD  TO WSL-MOD
046100        MOVE HIGH-RANGE-KEY TO WSH-KEY
046200        MOVE HIGH-RANGE-MOD TO WSH-MOD
046300        MOVE "DHDR41.PUB"   TO HD-FILE-NAME
046400     ELSE
046500     IF RPT-JCW-CODE = "42"
046600        MOVE RPT-JCW-CODE   TO RPT-JCW
046700        MOVE LANG-CODE      TO PRINT-LANGUAGE
046800        MOVE "DHDR42.PUB"   TO HD-FILE-NAME.
048500
048600 039-EXIT.  EXIT.
048800 100-DETERMINE-DESIRED-REPORT.
048900     IF RPT-JCW = "40"
049000        GO TO 101-READ-ALL-PARTS
049100     ELSE
049200     IF RPT-JCW = "41"
049300        GO TO 131-READ-ALL-KEYWORDS
049400     ELSE
049500     IF RPT-JCW = "42"
049600        GO TO 151-READ-ALL-CODES.
049800
049900*----------  CATALOG SORTED BY MANUFACTURER NAME AND PART NUMBER
050000 101-READ-ALL-PARTS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO MANUFACT OF DMANPART-REC-I.
           START DMANPART-I KEY IS GREATER OR EQUAL
                   MANUFACT OF DMANPART-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058400     IF END-OF-FILE
058500        GO TO 199-EXIT.

       102-READ-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DMANPART-I NEXT INTO BUF-DMANPART
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058600     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
058700        GO TO 199-EXIT.
050800
050900*----------  DETERMINE WHICH RECORDS SHOULD BE SELECTED
051000     IF ALL-ITEMS
051100        GO TO 115-WRITE-ENTRY.
051200
051300     IF MAN-NAME < LOW-RANGE-MNF
051400        GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
051500
051600     IF MAN-NAME > HIGH-RANGE-MNF
051700        GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
051800
051900 115-WRITE-ENTRY.
052000     MOVE MAN-NAME              TO SRTD-MAN-NAME.
052100     MOVE MAN-PARTNO-TYPE       TO SRTD-PARTNO-TYPE.
052200     MOVE MAN-PARTNO            TO SRTD-PART-NO.
052300     MOVE MAN-CORPCODE          TO SRTD-CODE.
052400     MOVE SPACES                TO SRTD-KEYWORD, SRTD-LOCAL-CODE.
052500     WRITE SRTD-RECORD.
052600
052700     GO TO 102-READ-LOOP.
052900
053000*----------  CATALOG SORTED BY KEYWORD/MODIFIER
053100 131-READ-ALL-KEYWORDS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
PDR        MOVE LOW-RANGE-KWM TO KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-I.
           START DCODE-I KEY IS GREATER OR EQUAL
                  KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058400     IF END-OF-FILE
058500        GO TO 199-EXIT.

       132-READ-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DCODE-I NEXT INTO BUF-DCODE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058600     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
058700        GO TO 199-EXIT.
053900
054000*----------  DETERMINE WHICH RECORDS SHOULD BE SELECTED
054200     IF PRIMARY-ONLY
054300        IF CODE-LANGUAGE-IND NOT = "1"
054400           GO TO 132-READ-LOOP.
054500     IF SECONDARY-ONLY
054600        IF CODE-LANGUAGE-IND NOT = "2"
054700           GO TO 132-READ-LOOP.
054800
054900     IF ALL-ITEMS
055000        GO TO 135-WRITE-ENTRY.
055100
055200     IF CODE-KEYWORD-MOD < LOW-RANGE-KWM
055300        GO TO 132-READ-LOOP.
055400
055500     IF CODE-KEYWORD-MOD > HIGH-RANGE-KWM
058700        GO TO 199-EXIT.
055700
055800 135-WRITE-ENTRY.
055900     MOVE CODE-KEYWORD-MOD      TO SRTD-KEYWORD.
056000     MOVE CODE-KEY-CODE         TO SRTD-CODE.
056100     MOVE SPACES                TO SRTD-MAN-NAME,
056200                                   SRTD-PARTNO-TYPE,
056300                                   SRTD-PART-NO,
056400                                   SRTD-LOCAL-CODE.
056500     WRITE SRTD-RECORD.
056600
056700     GO TO 132-READ-LOOP.
057000
057100*----------  CATALOG SORTED BY CODE
057200 151-READ-ALL-CODES.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           START MSTORERM-I KEY IS GREATER OR EQUAL
                    CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058400     IF END-OF-FILE
058500        GO TO 199-EXIT.

       152-READ-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MSTORERM-I NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
058600     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
058700        GO TO 199-EXIT.
058000
058100*----------  DETERMINE WHICH RECORDS SHOULD BE SELECTED
058200     IF CORP-CODE = "NON-STR "
058300        GO TO 152-READ-LOOP.
058400
058500     IF ALL-ITEMS AND STR-PREV-CODE = "121A STORES "
058600        GO TO 155-WRITE-ENTRY.
058700
058800     IF   (CORP-CODE < LOW-RANGE-CODE)
             OR (CORP-CODE > HIGH-RANGE-CODE)
             OR (STR-PREV-CODE NOT = "121A STORES ")
058900        GO TO 152-READ-LOOP.
059000
059400 155-WRITE-ENTRY.
059500     MOVE CORP-CODE             TO SRTD-CODE.
059600     MOVE STR-PREV-CODE         TO SRTD-LOCAL-CODE.
059700     MOVE SPACES                TO SRTD-MAN-NAME,
059800                                   SRTD-PARTNO-TYPE,
059900                                   SRTD-PART-NO,
060000                                   SRTD-KEYWORD.
060100     WRITE SRTD-RECORD.
060200
060300     GO TO 152-READ-LOOP.
060400
060500 199-EXIT.  EXIT.
060900*************************************************************
061000*                 SORT THE RECORDS                          *
061200*************************************************************
061300 300-SORT.
061400     CLOSE SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
061500
061600     IF RPT-JCW = "40"
061700     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-MAN-NAME
061800                                     SORT-PART-NO
061900                                     SORT-CODE
062000          USING  SORTED-PRINT-FILE
062100          GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
062200     ELSE
062300     IF RPT-JCW = "41"
062400     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-KEYWORD
062500                                     SORT-CODE
062600          USING  SORTED-PRINT-FILE
062700          GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
062800     ELSE
062900     IF RPT-JCW = "42"
063000        IF SORT-CODE-42 = "C"
063100          SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
063200               USING  SORTED-PRINT-FILE
063300               GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE
063400        ELSE
063500          SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-LOCAL-CODE
063600                                          SORT-CODE
063700               USING  SORTED-PRINT-FILE
063800               GIVING SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
063900
064000 399-EXIT.  EXIT.
064300*************************************************************
064400*                     PRINT THE REPORT                      *
064500*      READ EACH SORTED RECORD AND CALL "CDESC" TO OBTAIN   *
064600*      THE CODE'S DESCRIPTION BEFORE PRINTING.              *
064800*************************************************************
064900 400-PRINT-REPORT.
065000*---------- OPEN THE PRINT FILE, GET THE FILE NUMBER OF THE PRINT
065100*---------- FILE, AND PRINT THE HEADER PAGE.
065200     OPEN INPUT SORTED-PRINT-FILE.
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"       TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
028100     MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"      TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
065300     OPEN OUTPUT PRT-FILE.
065400
065500*----------  PARAMETERS FOR CALL TO CFINPTYP
065600     MOVE "Y" TO CFINPTYP-1ST-CALL.
065700*----------  LANGUAGE IS HARDCODED FOR NOW
065800     MOVE 1   TO CFINPTYP-LANGUAGE.
065900
066200     CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME, FNUM
066300       HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
066400     IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
066500         DISPLAY "THDPRT2 ERROR, RET-CODE = ", HD-RET-CODE
066600         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
066700
066800     IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
066900         NEXT SENTENCE
067000     ELSE
067100         WRITE PRT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0
067200         WRITE PRT-REC FROM ESC-TEXT-61    AFTER ADVANCING 0.
067300
067400*----------  DETERMINE IF PRIMARY OR SECONDARY LANGUAGE
067500*            WERE REQUESTED AND PRINT ACCORDINGLY.  (CURRENTLY
067600*            ONLY PRIMARY OR SECONDARY MAY BE CHOSEN).
067700     IF SECONDARY-ONLY
067800        MOVE "S" TO CDESC-LANGUAGE-OPTION
067900     ELSE
068000        MOVE "P" TO CDESC-LANGUAGE-OPTION.
068100
068200*----------  HAVE "CDESC" PROVIDE ALL MANUFACTURERS
068300     MOVE "A"    TO CDESC-MANUFACT-OPTION.
068400
068500 401-READ-LOOP.
068600     READ SORTED-PRINT-FILE
068700           AT END
068800             GO TO 499-EXIT.
068900
069000     CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE,
069100                        BASE,
069200                        STATUS-AREA,
069300                        BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
069400                        SRTD-CODE,
069500                        CDESC-DATA.
069600
069700     IF CDESC-RET-CODE IS EQUAL TO "00"
069800         NEXT SENTENCE
069900     ELSE
070000         IF CDESC-RET-CODE IS EQUAL TO "NF"
070100*----------  "NOT FOUND" - CDESC COULD NOT FIND THIS CODE
070200             GO TO 401-READ-LOOP
070300         ELSE
070400             PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
070500
070600*----------  DETERMINE IF THIS CODE WOULD BE SEPARATED BY A PAGE
070700*            BREAK.  IF SO, START CODE ON NEXT PAGE.
070800     ADD CDESC-LINES-GOT TO LINE-CTR.
070900     IF LINE-CTR > 60
071000        PERFORM 700-NEW-PAGE THRU 700-EXIT
071100        ADD CDESC-LINES-GOT TO LINE-CTR.
071200
072300*---------- PRINT THE 1ST LINE OF DESCRIPTION FOR THIS CODE
072400     MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
072500     MOVE SRTD-CODE             TO LINE1-CODE.
072600
072700     IF CDESC-TYPE (1) IS EQUAL TO "K"
072800         MOVE CDESC-KEYWORD (1)    TO LINE1-KEYWORD
072900         MOVE CDESC-MODIFIER (1)   TO LINE1-MODIFIER
073000     ELSE
073100         MOVE "* NO KEYWORD/MODIFIER ON FILE FOR THIS LANGUAGE *"
073200             TO LINE1-KWM.
073300
073400     MOVE SRTD-MAN-NAME         TO LINE1-MAN-NAME.
073500
073600     MOVE SRTD-PARTNO-TYPE      TO CFINPTYP-TYPE-DB.
073700     CALL "CFINPTYP" USING CFINPTYP-PARMS.
073800     MOVE "N"                   TO CFINPTYP-1ST-CALL.
073900     MOVE CFINPTYP-TYPE-SHORT   TO LINE1-TYPE.
074000
074100     MOVE SRTD-PART-NO          TO LINE1-PART-NO.
074200     MOVE SRTD-LOCAL-CODE       TO LINE1-LOCAL-CODE.
074300
074400     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
074500
074600*-------- PRINT THE REMAINING DESCRIPTION LINES WHICH WERE
074700*         RETURNED BY "CDESC".
074800*         IF THE FIRST DESCRIPTION LINE RETURNED BY "CDESC"
074900*         IS NOT THE KEYWORD/MODIFIER, IT WILL CONTAIN
075000*         MANUFACTURER DATA OR DESCRIPTION TEXT.
075100     IF CDESC-TYPE (1) IS EQUAL TO "K"
075200         PERFORM 500-PRINT-A-LINE THRU 500-PRINT-A-LINE-X
075300             VARYING SUB FROM 2 BY 1
075400               UNTIL SUB IS GREATER THAN CDESC-LINES-GOT
075500     ELSE
075600         ADD 1 TO LINE-CTR
075700         PERFORM 500-PRINT-A-LINE THRU 500-PRINT-A-LINE-X
075800             VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
075900               UNTIL SUB IS GREATER THAN CDESC-LINES-GOT.
076000
076100*------- PRINT A BLANK LINE
076200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM BLANK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
076300     ADD 1 TO LINE-CTR.
076400
076500     GO TO 401-READ-LOOP.
076600
076700 499-EXIT.  EXIT.
076800
076900 500-PRINT-A-LINE.
077000     MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE.
077100
077200*-------- MANUFACTURER DATA MUST BE SPECIALLY FORMATTED
077300     IF CDESC-TYPE (SUB) IS EQUAL TO "M"
077400         PERFORM 600-PRINT-MFR-DATA THRU 600-PRINT-MFR-DATA-X
077500     ELSE
077600         MOVE CDESC (SUB) TO LINE2-DESC
077700         WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
077800
077900 500-PRINT-A-LINE-X.
078000     EXIT.
078100
078200 600-PRINT-MFR-DATA.
078300*--------- IF A MANUFACTURER CATALOG IS BEING PRODUCED AVOID
078400*          REPEATING THE SAME MANUFACTURER INFO WHICH WAS PRINTED
078500*          ON THE FIRST REPORT LINE FOR THIS CODE (DATA FROM THE
078600*          SORT RECORD).
078700     IF RPT-JCW IS EQUAL TO "40"
078800         MOVE CDESC-MFR-TYPE (SUB) TO PARTNO-TYPE
078900         IF    (CDESC-MFR-NAME (SUB) = SRTD-MAN-NAME)
079000           AND (CDESC-MFR-PART (SUB) = SRTD-PART-NO)
079100           AND (PARTNO-TYPE1         = SRTD-PARTNO-TYPE)
079200              SUBTRACT 1 FROM LINE-CTR
079300              GO TO 600-PRINT-MFR-DATA-X.
079400
079500     MOVE CDESC-MFR-NAME (SUB) TO LINE1-MAN-NAME.
079600     MOVE CDESC-MFR-TYPE (SUB) TO LINE1-TYPE.
079700     MOVE CDESC-MFR-PART (SUB) TO LINE1-PART-NO.
079800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
079900
080000 600-PRINT-MFR-DATA-X.
080100     EXIT.
080300 700-NEW-PAGE.
080400     ADD 1                      TO PAGE-NUM.
080500
080600     MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
080700     MOVE "G O O D Y E A R   C O R P O R A T E   "
080800                                TO HEAD1-TITLE1.
080900     MOVE "S T O R E S   I N F O R M A T I O N   "
081000                                TO HEAD1-TITLE2.
081100     MOVE "S Y S T E M"         TO HEAD1-TITLE3.
081200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
081300
081400     MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
081500     MOVE 1                     TO DATE-MODE.
081600     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
081700     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO HEAD2-TIME.
081800     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT        TO HEAD2-DATE.
081900     MOVE "PAGE "               TO HEAD2-PAGE.
082000     MOVE PAGE-NUM              TO HEAD2-PAGE-NO.
082100
082200     IF RPT-JCW = "40"
082300         MOVE "CATALOG BY MANUFACTURER - PLANT " TO HEAD2-TITLE
082400     ELSE
082500     IF RPT-JCW = "41"
082600        MOVE "CATALOG BY KEYWORD - PLANT " TO HEAD2-TITLE
082700     ELSE
082800     IF RPT-JCW = "42"
082900         MOVE "CATALOG BY CODE - PLANT  " TO HEAD2-TITLE.
083000
083100     MOVE PLANT-NUMBER          TO HEAD2-PLANT.
083200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
083300
083400     MOVE SPACES                TO PRINT-LINE.
083500     IF ALL-ITEMS
083600        MOVE "RANGE:  ALL"      TO RANGE1
083700     ELSE
083800        MOVE "RANGE:  "         TO RANGE2-RANGE
083900        MOVE " TO "             TO RANGE2-TO
084000        IF RPT-JCW = "40"
084100            MOVE LOW-RANGE-MNF      TO RANGE2-LOW
084200            MOVE HIGH-RANGE-MNF     TO RANGE2-HIGH
084300        ELSE
084400        IF RPT-JCW = "41"
084500            MOVE LOW-RANGE-KWM      TO RANGE2-LOW
084600            MOVE HIGH-RANGE-KWM     TO RANGE2-HIGH
084700        ELSE
084800        IF RPT-JCW = "42"
084900            MOVE LOW-RANGE-CODE     TO RANGE2-LOW
085000            MOVE HIGH-RANGE-CODE    TO RANGE2-HIGH.
085100
085200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
085300
085400     MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
085500     MOVE "CODE"                 TO HEAD4-CODE.
085600     MOVE "KEYWORD"              TO HEAD4-KEYWORD.
085700     MOVE "MODIFIER"             TO HEAD4-MODIFIER.
085800     MOVE "MANUFACTURER"         TO HEAD4-MAN-NAME.
085900     MOVE "PART NUMBER"          TO HEAD4-PART-NO.
086000     MOVE "TYPE"                 TO HEAD4-TYPE.
086100
086200     IF RPT-JCW = "42"
086300        MOVE "LOCAL CODE"        TO HEAD4-LOCAL-CODE
086400     ELSE
086500        MOVE SPACES              TO HEAD4-LOCAL-CODE.
086600
086700     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
086800
086900     MOVE SPACES                 TO PRINT-LINE.
087000     MOVE ALL "="                TO HEAD4-CODE
087100                                    HEAD4-KEYWORD
087200                                    HEAD4-MODIFIER
087300                                    HEAD4-MAN-NAME
087400                                    HEAD4-TYPE
087500                                    HEAD4-PART-NO.
087600     IF RPT-JCW = "42"
087700        MOVE ALL "="             TO HEAD4-LOCAL-CODE
087800     ELSE
087900        MOVE SPACES              TO HEAD4-LOCAL-CODE.
088000
088100     WRITE PRT-REC FROM PRINT-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
088200
088300*---------- PRINT A BLANK LINE
088400     WRITE PRT-REC FROM BLANK-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
088500
088600     MOVE 7                      TO LINE-CTR.
088700
088800 700-EXIT.  EXIT.
       COPY OVRPFCALL OF COPYLIB.
089000************************************************************
089100************************************************************
089200*                    B L O W U P                           *
089300*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
089400*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
089500*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
089600*                                                          *
089700*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
089800*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
089900*                                                          *
090000*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
090100************************************************************
090200************************************************************
090300 990-BLOWUP.
090400*----------  PURGE THE FILE
090600     MOVE "TMFRPTA"          TO BU-PGM-NAME.
090700     MOVE "PRIMARY LANG"     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
090800     MOVE PRIMARY-LANGUAGE   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
090900     MOVE "SECONDARY LG"     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4).
091000     MOVE SECONDARY-LANGUAGE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5).
091100     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
091200           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
091300           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
091400
091500 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
